Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 11:03:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(ml): ggml device for the machine-learning image and
 docs

Adds builder-ggml and prod-ggml stages that build libclipvit with a pinned
ggml and ship it with the Vulkan loader and Mesa's drivers, a ggml entry in
hwaccel.ml.yml, and documentation for the backend and its settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VXX3uBLex4GVki947Lm5qV
